{% lede %}
Also inspired by the harmonic analyzer, this applet visualizes the synchronicity and apparent chaos of periodic motion coming in and out of phase, the "pendulum wave effect."
{% /lede %}

You can slow or pause the motion, change the number of oscillators, and toggle the drawing parameters that change how the animation looks.
